"cesty systemu souboru. Pouzivani cest s :func:`~mimetypes.guess_type` je "
"nyni :term:`soft deprecated`. (Prispeno Serhiy Storchaka v :gh:`66543`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:1011
msgid "mmap"
msgstr "mmap"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:1013
msgid ""
":class:`~mmap.mmap` is now protected from crashing on Windows when the "
"mapped memory is inaccessible due to file system errors or access "
"violations. (Contributed by Jannis Weigend in :gh:`118209`.)"
msgstr ""
":class:`~mmap.mmap` je nyni chranena pred padem v systemu Windows, kdyz je "
"mapovana pamet nedostupna z duvodu chyb systemu souboru nebo poresen "
"pristupovych prav. (Prispeno Jannis Weigend v :gh:`118209`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:1017
msgid ""
