" used when a seekable file-like object is required. The "
":meth:`~mmap.mmap.seek` method now returns the new absolute position. "
"(Contributed by Donghee Na and Sylvie Liberman in :gh:`111835`.)"
msgstr ""
":class:`~mmap.mmap` ma novou metodu :meth:`~mmap.mmap.seekable`, ktera lze "
"pouzit, kdyz je zapotrebi vyhledavajici objekt podobny souboru. Metoda "
":meth:`~mmap.mmap.seek` nyni vraci novou absolutní pozici. (Prispeno Donghee"
" Na a Sylvie Liberman v :gh:`111835`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:1022
msgid ""
"The new UNIX-only *trackfd* parameter for :class:`~mmap.mmap` controls file "
"descriptor duplication; if false, the file descriptor specified by *fileno* "
"will not be duplicated. (Contributed by Zackery Spytz and Petr Viktorin in "
":gh:`78502`.)"
msgstr ""
"Novy parametr *trackfd* pouze pro UNIX pro :class:`~mmap.mmap` ovlada "
"duplikaci deskriptoru souboru; pokud je false, deskriptor souboru "
"specifikovany *fileno* nebude duplikovan. (Prispeno Zackery Spytz a Petr "
"Viktorin v :gh:`78502`.)"

