"odstranenim zavislosti na :mod:`re` a :mod:`contextlib`. Jine moduly, ktere "
"se tesit zrychlenim importu, jsou :mod:`email.utils`, :mod:`enum`, "
":mod:`functools`, :mod:`importlib.metadata` a :mod:`threading`. (Prispeno "
"Alex Waygood, Shantanu Jain, Adam Turner, Daniel Hollas a dalsimi v "
":gh:`109653`.)"

