msgstr ""
":func:`!asyncio.iscoroutinefunction` je zastarala a bude odstranena v "
"Pythonu 3.16; pouzijte miste toho :func:`inspect.iscoroutinefunction`. "
"(Prispeno Jiahao Li a Kumar Aditya v :gh:`122875`.)"

