"argument instead. (Contributed by Mariusz Felisiak in :gh:`115032`.)"
msgstr ""
"Podpora vlastnich manipulatoru logovani s argumentem *strm* je zastarala a "
"naplavovana na odstranovani v Pythonu 3.16. Definujte manipulatory s "
"argumentem *stream* miste. (Prispeno Mariusz Felisiak v :gh:`115032`.)"

#: ../../deprecations/pending-removal-in-3.16.rst:72
