msgstr ""
"Podpora ``__complex__()`` metody vracejici prissou podtridu "
":class:`complex`: tyto metody budou vyrazovany, aby vracely instanci "
":class:`complex`."

#: ../../deprecations/pending-removal-in-future.rst:38
