msgid "CPython Bytecode Changes"
msgstr "Zmeny bytecode CPythonu"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2033
msgid ""
"The oparg of :opcode:`YIELD_VALUE` is now ``1`` if the yield is part of a "
"yield-from or await, and ``0`` otherwise. The oparg of :opcode:`RESUME` was "
"changed to add a bit indicating if the except-depth is 1, which is needed to"
" optimize closing of generators. (Contributed by Irit Katriel in "
":gh:`111354`.)"
msgstr ""
"Parametr oparg z :opcode:`YIELD_VALUE` je nyni ``1``, pokud je yield "
"soucasti yield-from nebo await, a ``0`` jinak. Parametr oparg z "
":opcode:`RESUME` byl zmenen, aby se pridal bit ukazujici, zda je except-"
"depth 1, coz je potrebne pro optimalizaci zavreni generatoru. (Prispel Irit "
"Katriel v :gh:`111354`.)"

