#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2091
msgid ""
"Add the :c:func:`PyDict_ContainsString` function with the same behavior as "
":c:func:`PyDict_Contains`, but *key* is specified as a :c:expr:`const char*`"
" UTF-8 encoded bytes string, rather than a :c:expr:`PyObject*`. (Contributed"
" by Victor Stinner in :gh:`108314`.)"
msgstr ""
"Pridej funkci :c:func:`PyDict_ContainsString` se stejnym chovanim jako "
":c:func:`PyDict_Contains`, ale *key* je specifikovan jako :c:expr:`const "
"char*` UTF-8 kodovany retezec bajtu, nikoliv :c:expr:`PyObject*`. (Prispel "
"Victor Stinner v :gh:`108314`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2097
msgid ""
"Add the :c:func:`PyDict_GetItemRef` and :c:func:`PyDict_GetItemStringRef` "
"functions, which behave similarly to :c:func:`PyDict_GetItemWithError`, but "
"return a  :term:`strong reference` instead of a :term:`borrowed reference`. "
"Moreover, these functions return ``-1`` on error, removing the need to check"
" :c:func:`!PyErr_Occurred`. (Contributed by Victor Stinner in :gh:`106004`.)"
msgstr ""
"Pridej funkce :c:func:`PyDict_GetItemRef` a "
":c:func:`PyDict_GetItemStringRef`, ktere se chovaji podobne jako "
":c:func:`PyDict_GetItemWithError`, ale vracejici :term:`strong reference` "
"miste :term:`borrowed reference`. Dale tyto funkce vracejici ``-1`` pri "
"chybe, cimz se odstranjuje potreba kontrolovat :c:func:`!PyErr_Occurred`. "
"(Prispel Victor Stinner v :gh:`106004`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2105
msgid ""
"Add the :c:func:`PyDict_SetDefaultRef` function, which behaves similarly to "
":c:func:`PyDict_SetDefault`, but returns a :term:`strong reference` instead "
"of a :term:`borrowed reference`. This function returns ``-1`` on error, "
"``0`` on insertion, and ``1`` if the key was already present in the "
"dictionary. (Contributed by Sam Gross in :gh:`112066`.)"
msgstr ""
"Pridej funkci :c:func:`PyDict_SetDefaultRef`, ktera se chova podobne jako "
":c:func:`PyDict_SetDefault`, ale vraci :term:`strong reference` miste "
":term:`borrowed reference`. Tato funkce vraci ``-1`` pri chybe, ``0`` pri "
"vlozeni a ``1``, pokud byl klic jiz v slovniku pritomen. (Prispel Sam Gross "
"v :gh:`112066`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2113
msgid ""
"Add the :c:func:`PyDict_Pop` and :c:func:`PyDict_PopString` functions to "
"remove a key from a dictionary and optionally return the removed value. This"
" is similar to :meth:`dict.pop`, though there is no default value, and "
":exc:`KeyError` is not raised for missing keys. (Contributed by Stefan "
"Behnel and Victor Stinner in :gh:`111262`.)"
msgstr ""
"Pridej funkce :c:func:`PyDict_Pop` a :c:func:`PyDict_PopString` pro odebrani"
" klice ze slovniku a volitelne vraceni odebrane hodnoty. Toto je podobne "
"jako :meth:`dict.pop`, avsak neni k dispozici vychozi hodnota a "
":exc:`KeyError` neni vyvolan pro chybejici klice. (Prispeli Stefan Behnel a "
"Victor Stinner v :gh:`111262`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2120
msgid ""
"Add the :c:func:`PyMapping_GetOptionalItem` and "
":c:func:`PyMapping_GetOptionalItemString` functions as alternatives to "
":c:func:`PyObject_GetItem` and :c:func:`PyMapping_GetItemString` "
"respectively. The new functions do not raise :exc:`KeyError` if the "
"requested key is missing from the mapping. These variants are more "
"convenient and faster if a missing key should not be treated as a failure. "
"(Contributed by Serhiy Storchaka in :gh:`106307`.)"
msgstr ""
"Pridej funkce :c:func:`PyMapping_GetOptionalItem` a "
":c:func:`PyMapping_GetOptionalItemString` jako alternativy k "
":c:func:`PyObject_GetItem` a :c:func:`PyMapping_GetItemString`. Nove funkce "
"nevyvoluji :exc:`KeyError`, pokud pozadovany klic chybi v mapovani. Tyto "
"varianty jsou pohodlnejsi a rychlejsi, pokud by chybejici klic nemel byt "
"povazovan za selhani. (Prispel Serhiy Storchaka v :gh:`106307`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2130
msgid ""
"Add the :c:func:`PyObject_GetOptionalAttr` and "
":c:func:`PyObject_GetOptionalAttrString` functions as alternatives to  "
":c:func:`PyObject_GetAttr` and :c:func:`PyObject_GetAttrString` "
"respectively. The new functions do not raise :exc:`AttributeError` if the "
"requested attribute is not found on the object. These variants are more "
"convenient and faster if the missing attribute should not be treated as a "
"failure. (Contributed by Serhiy Storchaka in :gh:`106521`.)"
msgstr ""
"Pridej funkce :c:func:`PyObject_GetOptionalAttr` a "
":c:func:`PyObject_GetOptionalAttrString` jako alternativy k "
":c:func:`PyObject_GetAttr` a :c:func:`PyObject_GetAttrString`. Nove funkce "
"nevyvoluji :exc:`AttributeError`, pokud pozadovany atribut neni na objektu "
"nalezen. Tyto varianty jsou pohodlnejsi a rychlejsi, pokud by chybejici "
"atribut nemel byt povazovan za selhani. (Prispel Serhiy Storchaka v "
":gh:`106521`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2140
msgid ""
"Add the :c:func:`PyErr_FormatUnraisable` function as an extension to "
":c:func:`PyErr_WriteUnraisable` that allows customizing the warning message."
" (Contributed by Serhiy Storchaka in :gh:`108082`.)"
msgstr ""
"Pridej funkci :c:func:`PyErr_FormatUnraisable` jako rozsireni "
":c:func:`PyErr_WriteUnraisable`, ktere umoznuje prilagodeni varovne zpravy. "
"(Prispel Serhiy Storchaka v :gh:`108082`.)"

