#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2181
msgid ""
"Add the :c:func:`PyLong_AsInt` function. It behaves similarly to "
":c:func:`PyLong_AsLong`, but stores the result in a C :c:expr:`int` instead "
"of a C :c:expr:`long`. (Contributed by Victor Stinner in :gh:`108014`.)"
msgstr ""
"Pridej funkci :c:func:`PyLong_AsInt`. Chova se podobne jako "
":c:func:`PyLong_AsLong`, ale vysledek uklada v C :c:expr:`int` miste C "
":c:expr:`long`. (Prispel Victor Stinner v :gh:`108014`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2186
msgid ""
"Add the :c:func:`PyLong_AsNativeBytes`, :c:func:`PyLong_FromNativeBytes`, "
"and :c:func:`PyLong_FromUnsignedNativeBytes` functions to simplify "
"converting between native integer types and Python :class:`int` objects. "
"(Contributed by Steve Dower in :gh:`111140`.)"
msgstr ""
"Pridej funkce :c:func:`PyLong_AsNativeBytes`, "
":c:func:`PyLong_FromNativeBytes` a :c:func:`PyLong_FromUnsignedNativeBytes` "
"pro zjednoduseni konverze mezi nativnimi celosilkovymi typy a Pythonovskymi "
":class:`int` objekty. (Prispel Steve Dower v :gh:`111140`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2192
msgid ""
"Add :c:func:`PyModule_Add` function, which is similar to "
":c:func:`PyModule_AddObjectRef` and :c:func:`PyModule_AddObject`, but always"
" steals a reference to the value. (Contributed by Serhiy Storchaka in "
":gh:`86493`.)"
msgstr ""
"Pridej funkci :c:func:`PyModule_Add`, ktera je podobna "
":c:func:`PyModule_AddObjectRef` a :c:func:`PyModule_AddObject`, ale vzdy "
"ukradne odkaz na hodnotu. (Prispel Serhiy Storchaka v :gh:`86493`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2197
msgid ""
"Add the :c:func:`PyObject_GenericHash` function that implements the default "
"hashing function of a Python object. (Contributed by Serhiy Storchaka in "
":gh:`113024`.)"
msgstr ""
"Pridej funkci :c:func:`PyObject_GenericHash`, ktera implementuje vychozi "
"hashovaci funkci objektu Pythonu. (Prispel Serhiy Storchaka v :gh:`113024`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2201
msgid ""
"Add the :c:func:`Py_HashPointer` function to hash a raw pointer. "
"(Contributed by Victor Stinner in :gh:`111545`.)"
msgstr ""
"Pridej funkci :c:func:`Py_HashPointer` pro hashovanl suroveho ukazatele. "
"(Prispel Victor Stinner v :gh:`111545`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2204
msgid ""
"Add the :c:func:`PyObject_VisitManagedDict` and "
":c:func:`PyObject_ClearManagedDict` functions. which must be called by the "
"traverse and clear functions of a type using the "
":c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_MANAGED_DICT` flag. The `pythoncapi-compat project`_ "
"can be used to use these functions with Python 3.11 and 3.12. (Contributed "
"by Victor Stinner in :gh:`107073`.)"
msgstr ""
"Pridej funkce :c:func:`PyObject_VisitManagedDict` a "
":c:func:`PyObject_ClearManagedDict`, ktere musi byt vvolany funkcemi "
"traverse a clear typu pouzivajiciho vlajku "
":c:macro:`Py_TPFLAGS_MANAGED_DICT`. Projekt `pythoncapi-compat project`_ lze"
" pouzit pro pouziti techto funkci s Pythonem 3.11 a 3.12. (Prispel Victor "
"Stinner v :gh:`107073`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2212
msgid ""
"Add the :c:func:`PyRefTracer_SetTracer` and :c:func:`PyRefTracer_GetTracer` "
"functions, which enable tracking object creation and destruction in the same"
" way that the :mod:`tracemalloc` module does. (Contributed by Pablo Galindo "
"in :gh:`93502`.)"
msgstr ""
"Pridej funkce :c:func:`PyRefTracer_SetTracer` a "
":c:func:`PyRefTracer_GetTracer`, ktere umoznuji sledovani vytvareni a "
"zniceovani objektu stejnym zpusobem jako modul :mod:`tracemalloc`. (Prispel "
"Pablo Galindo v :gh:`93502`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2218
msgid ""
"Add the :c:func:`PySys_AuditTuple` function as an alternative to "
":c:func:`PySys_Audit` that takes event arguments as a Python :class:`tuple` "
"object. (Contributed by Victor Stinner in :gh:`85283`.)"
msgstr ""
"Pridej funkci :c:func:`PySys_AuditTuple` jako alternativu k "
":c:func:`PySys_Audit`, ktera prijima argumenty udalosti jako objekt Python "
":class:`tuple`. (Prispel Victor Stinner v :gh:`85283`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2223
msgid ""
"Add the :c:func:`PyThreadState_GetUnchecked()` function as an alternative to"
" :c:func:`PyThreadState_Get()` that doesn't kill the process with a fatal "
"error if it is ``NULL``. The caller is responsible for checking if the "
"result is ``NULL``. (Contributed by Victor Stinner in :gh:`108867`.)"
msgstr ""
"Pridej funkci :c:func:`PyThreadState_GetUnchecked()` jako alternativu k "
":c:func:`PyThreadState_Get()`, ktera neuzavira proces s fatalnim chybou, "
"pokud je ``NULL``. Volajici je zodpovedan za kontrolu, zda je vysledek "
"``NULL``. (Prispel Victor Stinner v :gh:`108867`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2229
msgid ""
"Add the :c:func:`PyType_GetFullyQualifiedName` function to get the type's "
"fully qualified name. The module name is prepended if "
":attr:`type.__module__` is a string and is not equal to either "
"``'builtins'`` or ``'__main__'``. (Contributed by Victor Stinner in "
":gh:`111696`.)"
msgstr ""
"Pridej funkci :c:func:`PyType_GetFullyQualifiedName` pro ziskani plne "
"kvalifikovaneho nazvu typu. Nazev modulu je pridan, pokud "
":attr:`type.__module__` je retezec a neni roven ani ``'builtins'`` ani "
"``'__main__'``. (Prispel Victor Stinner v :gh:`111696`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2235
msgid ""
"Add the :c:func:`PyType_GetModuleName` function to get the type's module "
"name. This is equivalent to getting the :attr:`type.__module__` attribute. "
"(Contributed by Eric Snow and Victor Stinner in :gh:`111696`.)"
msgstr ""
"Pridej funkci :c:func:`PyType_GetModuleName` pro ziskani nazvu modulu typu. "
"To je ekvivalentni ziskani atributu :attr:`type.__module__`. (Prispeli Eric "
"Snow a Victor Stinner v :gh:`111696`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2240
msgid ""
"Add the :c:func:`PyUnicode_EqualToUTF8AndSize` and "
":c:func:`PyUnicode_EqualToUTF8` functions to compare a Unicode object with a"
" :c:expr:`const char*` UTF-8 encoded string and ``1`` if they are equal or "
"``0`` otherwise. These functions do not raise exceptions. (Contributed by "
"Serhiy Storchaka in :gh:`110289`.)"
msgstr ""
"Pridej funkce :c:func:`PyUnicode_EqualToUTF8AndSize` a "
":c:func:`PyUnicode_EqualToUTF8` pro porovnani objektu Unicode s retezcem "
":c:expr:`const char*` kodovanym UTF-8 a ``1``, pokud jsou si rovny, nebo "
"``0`` jinak. Tyto funkce nevyvoluji vyjimky. (Prispel Serhiy Storchaka v "
":gh:`110289`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2247
msgid ""
"Add the :c:func:`PyWeakref_GetRef` function as an alternative to  "
":c:func:`PyWeakref_GetObject` that returns a :term:`strong reference` or "
"``NULL`` if the referent is no longer live. (Contributed by Victor Stinner "
"in :gh:`105927`.)"
msgstr ""
"Pridej funkci :c:func:`PyWeakref_GetRef` jako alternativu k "
":c:func:`PyWeakref_GetObject`, ktera vraci :term:`strong reference` nebo "
"``NULL``, pokud je referencovany objekt uz mrtvy. (Prispel Victor Stinner v "
":gh:`105927`.)"

