"``_PY`` (ktere se povazuji za privatni). Pokud je vase projekt ovlivnen "
"jednim z techto odstranenych prvku a verite, ze odstranjene API by melo "
"zustati dostupne, prosim :ref:`otevrte novy problem <using-the-tracker>` pro"
" zadost o verejne C API a pridejte ``cc: @vstinner`` do problemu, abyste "
"upozornili Victora Stinnera. (Prispel Victor Stinner v :gh:`106320`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2355
msgid ""
"Remove old buffer protocols deprecated in Python 3.0. Use "
":ref:`bufferobjects` instead."
msgstr ""
"Odstranj stare protokoly vyrovnavacich pamet zastarale v Pythonu 3.0. Pouzij"
" :ref:`bufferobjects`."

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2358
msgid ""
":c:func:`!PyObject_CheckReadBuffer`: Use :c:func:`PyObject_CheckBuffer` to "
"test whether the object supports the buffer protocol. Note that "
":c:func:`PyObject_CheckBuffer` doesn't guarantee that "
":c:func:`PyObject_GetBuffer` will succeed. To test if the object is actually"
" readable, see the next example of :c:func:`PyObject_GetBuffer`."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`!PyObject_CheckReadBuffer`: Pouzij :c:func:`PyObject_CheckBuffer` "
"pro testovani, zda objekt podporuje buffer protokol. Poznamka: "
":c:func:`PyObject_CheckBuffer` negarantuje, ze :c:func:`PyObject_GetBuffer` "
"uspe. Pro testovani, zda je objekt skutecne ctitelny, viz dalsi priklad "
":c:func:`PyObject_GetBuffer`."

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2366
msgid ""
