msgstr "(Prispel Inada Naoki v :gh:`85275`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2393
msgid "Remove various functions deprecated in Python 3.9:"
msgstr "Odstranj ruzne funkce zastarale v Pythonu 3.9:"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2395
msgid ""
":c:func:`!PyEval_CallObject`, :c:func:`!PyEval_CallObjectWithKeywords`: Use "
":c:func:`PyObject_CallNoArgs` or :c:func:`PyObject_Call` instead."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`!PyEval_CallObject`, :c:func:`!PyEval_CallObjectWithKeywords`: "
"Pouzij :c:func:`PyObject_CallNoArgs` nebo :c:func:`PyObject_Call` miste."

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2400
msgid ""
"In :c:func:`PyObject_Call`, positional arguments must be a :class:`tuple` "
"and must not be ``NULL``, and keyword arguments must be a :class:`dict` or "
"``NULL``, whereas the removed functions checked argument types and accepted "
"``NULL`` positional and keyword arguments. To replace "
"``PyEval_CallObjectWithKeywords(func, NULL, kwargs)`` with "
":c:func:`PyObject_Call`, pass an empty tuple as positional arguments using "
":c:func:`PyTuple_New(0) <PyTuple_New>`."
msgstr ""
"V :c:func:`PyObject_Call` musi byt pozialni argumenty :class:`tuple` a "
"nesmejici byt ``NULL``, a klicove argumenty musi byt :class:`dict` nebo "
"``NULL``, kdezto odstranjene funkce kontrolovaly typy argumentu a prijimaly "
"``NULL`` pozialni a klicove argumenty. Pro nahrazeni "
"``PyEval_CallObjectWithKeywords(func, NULL, kwargs)`` s "
":c:func:`PyObject_Call`, prosim prejdi prazdnym n-ticim jako pozialni "
"argumenty pouzitim :c:func:`PyTuple_New(0) <PyTuple_New>`."

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2410
msgid ""
