"``arm64-apple-ios`` a ``arm64-apple-ios-simulator`` jsou oba nyni :pep:`11` "
"platformy urovne 3. (:ref:`PEP 730 <whatsnew313-platform-support>` napsany a"
" implementace prispela Russell Keith-Magee v :gh:`114099`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2564
msgid ""
"``aarch64-linux-android`` and ``x86_64-linux-android`` are both now "
":pep:`11` tier 3 platforms. (:ref:`PEP 738 <whatsnew313-platform-support>` "
"written and implementation contributed by Malcolm Smith in :gh:`116622`.)"
msgstr ""
"``aarch64-linux-android`` a ``x86_64-linux-android`` jsou oba nyni :pep:`11`"
" platformy urovne 3. (:ref:`PEP 738 <whatsnew313-platform-support>` napsany "
"a implementace prispel Malcolm Smith v :gh:`116622`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2569
msgid ""
"``wasm32-wasi`` is now a :pep:`11` tier 2 platform. (Contributed by Brett "
"Cannon in :gh:`115192`.)"
msgstr ""
"``wasm32-wasi`` je nyni :pep:`11` platforma urovne 2. (Prispel Brett Cannon "
"v :gh:`115192`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2572
msgid ""
"``wasm32-emscripten`` is no longer a :pep:`11` supported platform. "
"(Contributed by Brett Cannon in :gh:`115192`.)"
msgstr ""
"``wasm32-emscripten`` je jiz :pep:`11` podporovana platforma. (Prispel Brett"
" Cannon v :gh:`115192`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2575
msgid ""
"Building CPython now requires a compiler with support for the C11 atomic "
"library, GCC built-in atomic functions, or MSVC interlocked intrinsics."
msgstr ""
"Sestavovani CPythonu nyni vyzaduje kompilatr s podporou knihovny C11 atomic,"
" vestavene atomove funkce GCC nebo interlocked intrinsics MSVC."

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2578
msgid ""
"Autoconf 2.71 and aclocal 1.16.5 are now required to regenerate the "
":file:`configure` script. (Contributed by Christian Heimes in :gh:`89886` "
"and by Victor Stinner in :gh:`112090`.)"
msgstr ""
"Autoconf 2.71 a aclocal 1.16.5 jsou nyni vyzadovany pro regeneraci skriptu "
":file:`configure`. (Prispeli Christian Heimes v :gh:`89886` a Victor Stinner"
" v :gh:`112090`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2582
msgid ""
"SQLite 3.15.2 or newer is required to build the :mod:`sqlite3` extension "
"module. (Contributed by Erlend Aasland in :gh:`105875`.)"
msgstr ""
"SQLite 3.15.2 nebo novejsi je vyzadovan pro sestaveni rozsiujiciho modulu "
":mod:`sqlite3`. (Prispel Erlend Aasland v :gh:`105875`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2586
msgid ""
"CPython now bundles the `mimalloc library`_ by default. It is licensed under"
" the MIT license; see :ref:`mimalloc license <mimalloc-license>`. The "
"bundled mimalloc has custom changes, see :gh:`113141` for details. "
"(Contributed by Dino Viehland in :gh:`109914`.)"
msgstr ""
"CPython nyni zabaluje knihovnu `mimalloc library`_ jako vychozi. Je "
"licencovana pod licenci MIT; vizte :ref:`mimalloc license <mimalloc-"
"license>`. Zabaleninova mimalloc ma vlastni zmeny, viz :gh:`113141` pro "
"detaily. (Prispel Dino Viehland v :gh:`109914`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2594
msgid ""
"The :file:`configure` option :option:`--with-system-libmpdec` now defaults "
"to ``yes``. The bundled copy of ``libmpdec`` will be removed in Python 3.16."
msgstr ""
"Volba :file:`configure` :option:`--with-system-libmpdec` se nyni vychozi na "
"``yes``. Zabaleninova kopie ``libmpdec`` bude odstranjeno v Pythonu 3.16."

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2598
msgid ""
"Python built with :file:`configure` :option:`--with-trace-refs` (tracing "
"references) is now ABI compatible with the Python release build and "
":ref:`debug build <debug-build>`. (Contributed by Victor Stinner in "
":gh:`108634`.)"
msgstr ""
"Python postaveny s :file:`configure` :option:`--with-trace-refs` (sledovani "
"odkazu) je nyni kompatibilni s vydanym sestavenim Pythonu a :ref:`debug "
"build <debug-build>`. (Prispel Victor Stinner v :gh:`108634`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2603
msgid ""
"On POSIX systems, the pkg-config (``.pc``) filenames now include the ABI "
"flags.  For example, the free-threaded build generates ``python-3.13t.pc`` "
"and the debug build generates ``python-3.13d.pc``."
msgstr ""
"Na systemech POSIX se nazvy souboru pkg-config (``.pc``) nyni obsahuji "
"vlajky ABI. Priklad: bezplatne konstruovane sestaveni generuje "
"``python-3.13t.pc`` a ladicim sestavenym ``python-3.13d.pc``."

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2607
msgid ""
"The ``errno``, ``fcntl``, ``grp``, ``md5``, ``pwd``, ``resource``, "
"``termios``, ``winsound``, ``_ctypes_test``, "
"``_multiprocessing.posixshmem``, ``_scproxy``, ``_stat``, ``_statistics``, "
"``_testconsole``, ``_testimportmultiple`` and ``_uuid`` C extensions are now"
" built with the :ref:`limited C API <limited-c-api>`. (Contributed by Victor"
" Stinner in :gh:`85283`.)"
msgstr ""
"Rozsireni C ``errno``, ``fcntl``, ``grp``, ``md5``, ``pwd``, ``resource``, "
"``termios``, ``winsound``, ``_ctypes_test``, "
"``_multiprocessing.posixshmem``, ``_scproxy``, ``_stat``, ``_statistics``, "
"``_testconsole``, ``_testimportmultiple`` a ``_uuid`` jsou nyni vytvarena s "
":ref:`limited C API <limited-c-api>`. (Prispel Victor Stinner v "
":gh:`85283`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2616
msgid "Porting to Python 3.13"
msgstr "Prenositelnost do Pythonu 3.13"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2618
msgid ""
"This section lists previously described changes and other bugfixes that may "
"require changes to your code."
msgstr ""
"Tato sekce obsahuje seznam driv popsanych zmen a dalších oprav chyb, ktere "
"mohou vyzadovat zmeny vaseho kodu."

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2622
msgid "Changes in the Python API"
msgstr "Zmeny v Pythonovskem API"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2626
msgid ""
":ref:`PEP 667 <whatsnew313-locals-semantics>` introduces several changes to "
"the semantics of :func:`locals` and :attr:`f_locals <frame.f_locals>`:"
msgstr ""
":ref:`PEP 667 <whatsnew313-locals-semantics>` zavadi nektere zmeny "
"semanticky :func:`locals` a :attr:`f_locals <frame.f_locals>`:"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2629
msgid ""
"Calling :func:`locals` in an :term:`optimized scope` now produces an "
"independent snapshot on each call, and hence no longer implicitly updates "
"previously returned references. Obtaining the legacy CPython behavior now "
"requires explicit calls to update the initially returned dictionary with the"
" results of subsequent calls to :func:`!locals`. Code execution functions "
"that implicitly target :func:`!locals` (such as ``exec`` and ``eval``) must "
"be passed an explicit namespace to access their results in an optimized "
"scope. (Changed as part of :pep:`667`.)"
msgstr ""
"Volani :func:`locals` v :term:`optimized scope` nyni vytvari nezavislou "
"snimku na kazdou volani, a proto jiz ne implicitne aktualizuje driv vracene "
"odkazy. Ziskani dedicea chovani CPythonu nyni vyzaduje explicitni volani "
"aktualizace inicialne vraceneho slovniku vysledky nasledujicich volani na "
":func:`!locals`. Funkce provedeni kodu, ktere implicitne cili "
":func:`!locals` (jako ``exec`` a ``eval``) musi byt predat explicitni "
"namespace pro pristup jejich vysledkem v optimalizovane oboru. (Zmeneno jako"
" soucasti :pep:`667`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2638
msgid ""
"Calling :func:`locals` from a comprehension at module or class scope "
"(including via ``exec`` or ``eval``) once more behaves as if the "
"comprehension were running as an independent nested function (i.e. the local"
" variables from the containing scope are not included). In Python 3.12, this"
" had changed to include the local variables from the containing scope when "
"implementing :pep:`709`. (Changed as part of :pep:`667`.)"
msgstr ""
"Volani :func:`locals` z vyctu na modul nebo tridu oboru (vcetn pres ``exec``"
" nebo ``eval``) znovu se chova, jako by vycet beh jako nezavisle vnorena "
"funkce (tj. lokalni promenne z obsazenem oboru nejsou zahrnuty). V Pythonu "
"3.12 to se zmelo zahrnovat lokalni promenne z obsazenem oboru pri "
"implementaci :pep:`709`. (Zmeneno jako soucasti :pep:`667`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2645
msgid ""
"Accessing :attr:`FrameType.f_locals <frame.f_locals>` in an :term:`optimized"
" scope` now returns a write-through proxy rather than a snapshot that gets "
"updated at ill-specified times. If a snapshot is desired, it must be created"
" explicitly with ``dict`` or the proxy's ``.copy()`` method. (Changed as "
"part of :pep:`667`.)"
msgstr ""
"Pristup k :attr:`FrameType.f_locals <frame.f_locals>` v :term:`optimized "
"scope` nyni vraci proxy s zpetnym zapisem miste snimku, ktera se aktualizuje"
" v ne-specifickych casech. Pokud je snimka pozadovana, musi byt vytvorena "
"explicitne s ``dict`` nebo metodou ``.copy()`` proxy. (Zmeneno jako soucasti"
" :pep:`667`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2651
msgid ""
":class:`functools.partial` now emits a :exc:`FutureWarning` when used as a "
"method. The behavior will change in future Python versions. Wrap it in "
":func:`staticmethod` if you want to preserve the old behavior. (Contributed "
"by Serhiy Storchaka in :gh:`121027`.)"
msgstr ""
":class:`functools.partial` nyni vyzarivuje :exc:`FutureWarning` pouzije-li "
"se jako metoda. Chovanise zmeni v budoucich verzich Pythonu. Obbalit v "
":func:`staticmethod`, pokud chces zachovat stare chovanim. (Prispel Serhiy "
"Storchaka v :gh:`121027`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2657
msgid ""
"An :exc:`OSError` is now raised by :func:`getpass.getuser` for any failure "
"to retrieve a username, instead of :exc:`ImportError` on non-Unix platforms "
"or :exc:`KeyError` on Unix platforms where the password database is empty."
msgstr ""
"An :exc:`OSError` je nyni vyvolen :func:`getpass.getuser` pro jakekoli "
"selhani pri ziskani uzivatelskeho jmena, miste :exc:`ImportError` na non-"
"Unix platformach nebo :exc:`KeyError` na Unix platformach, kde je databaze "
"hesel prazdna."

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2662
msgid ""
"The value of the :attr:`!mode` attribute of :class:`gzip.GzipFile` is now a "
"string (``'rb'`` or ``'wb'``) instead of an integer (``1`` or ``2``). The "
"value of the :attr:`!mode` attribute of the readable file-like object "
"returned by :meth:`zipfile.ZipFile.open` is now ``'rb'`` instead of ``'r'``."
" (Contributed by Serhiy Storchaka in :gh:`115961`.)"
msgstr ""
"Hodnota atributu :attr:`!mode` z :class:`gzip.GzipFile` je nyni retezec "
"(``'rb'`` nebo ``'wb'``) namiste cisla (``1`` nebo ``2``). Hodnota atributu "
":attr:`!mode` cisitelneho objektu podobneho souboru vracenych "
":meth:`zipfile.ZipFile.open` je nyni ``'rb'`` namiste ``'r'``. (Prispel "
"Serhiy Storchaka v :gh:`115961`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2668
msgid ""
":class:`mailbox.Maildir` now ignores files with a leading dot (``.``). "
"(Contributed by Zackery Spytz in :gh:`65559`.)"
msgstr ""
":class:`mailbox.Maildir` nyni ignoruje soubory s vedoucim bodem (``.``). "
"(Prispel Zackery Spytz v :gh:`65559`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2671
msgid ""
":meth:`pathlib.Path.glob` and :meth:`~pathlib.Path.rglob` now return both "
"files and directories if a pattern that ends with \"``**``\" is given, "
"rather than directories only. Add a trailing slash to keep the previous "
"behavior and only match directories."
msgstr ""
":meth:`pathlib.Path.glob` a :meth:`~pathlib.Path.rglob` nyni vracejici "
"soubory i adresare, pokud je dan vzor, ktery konci s \"``**``\", miste jen "
"adresaru. Pridej koncujici lomitko pro zachovani predchoziho chovani a pouze"
" soupovani adresaru."

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2676
msgid ""
"The :mod:`threading` module now expects the :mod:`!_thread` module to have "
"an :func:`!_is_main_interpreter` function. This function takes no arguments "
"and returns ``True`` if the current interpreter is the main interpreter."
msgstr ""
"Modul :mod:`threading` nyni ocekava modul :mod:`!_thread` tak, aby mel "
"funkci :func:`!_is_main_interpreter`. Tato funkce neprijima zadne argumenty "
"a vraci ``True``, pokud je soucasny interpret hlavnim interpretem."

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2681
msgid ""
"Any library or application that provides a custom :mod:`!_thread` module "
"must provide :func:`!_is_main_interpreter`, just like the module's other "
"\"private\" attributes. (:gh:`112826`.)"
msgstr ""
"Jakakoli knihovna nebo aplikace, ktera poskytuje vlastni modul "
":mod:`!_thread` musi poskytnout :func:`!_is_main_interpreter`, stejne jako "
"ostatni \"privatni\" atributy modulu. (:gh:`112826`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2688
msgid "Changes in the C API"
msgstr "Zmeny v C API"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2690
msgid ""
"``Python.h`` no longer includes the ``<ieeefp.h>`` standard header. It was "
"included for the :c:func:`!finite` function which is now provided by the "
"``<math.h>`` header. It should now be included explicitly if needed. Remove "
"also the ``HAVE_IEEEFP_H`` macro. (Contributed by Victor Stinner in "
":gh:`108765`.)"
msgstr ""
"``Python.h`` jiz neobsahuje standardni hlavicku ``<ieeefp.h>``. Byla "
"zahrnuty pro funkci :c:func:`!finite`, ktera je nyni poskytnuta hlavickou "
"``<math.h>``. Mela by nyni byt zahrnuta explicitne, je-li potreba. Odstranj "
"take makro ``HAVE_IEEEFP_H``. (Prispel Victor Stinner v :gh:`108765`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2696
msgid ""
"``Python.h`` no longer includes these standard header files: ``<time.h>``, "
"``<sys/select.h>`` and ``<sys/time.h>``. If needed, they should now be "
"included explicitly. For example, ``<time.h>`` provides the :c:func:`!clock`"
" and :c:func:`!gmtime` functions, ``<sys/select.h>`` provides the "
":c:func:`!select` function, and ``<sys/time.h>`` provides the "
":c:func:`!futimes`, :c:func:`!gettimeofday` and :c:func:`!setitimer` "
"functions. (Contributed by Victor Stinner in :gh:`108765`.)"
msgstr ""
"``Python.h`` jiz neobsahuje tyto standardni soubory hlavicek: ``<time.h>``, "
"``<sys/select.h>`` a ``<sys/time.h>``. Je-li potreba, meli by nyni byt "
"zahrnuti explicitne. Priklad: ``<time.h>`` poskytuje funkce :c:func:`!clock`"
" a :c:func:`!gmtime`, ``<sys/select.h>`` poskytuje funkci :c:func:`!select` "
"a ``<sys/time.h>`` poskytuje funkce :c:func:`!futimes`, "
":c:func:`!gettimeofday` a :c:func:`!setitimer`. (Prispel Victor Stinner v "
":gh:`108765`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2704
msgid ""
"On Windows, ``Python.h`` no longer includes the ``<stddef.h>`` standard "
"header file. If needed, it should now be included explicitly. For example, "
"it provides :c:func:`!offsetof` function, and ``size_t`` and ``ptrdiff_t`` "
"types. Including ``<stddef.h>`` explicitly was already needed by all other "
"platforms, the ``HAVE_STDDEF_H`` macro is only defined on Windows. "
"(Contributed by Victor Stinner in :gh:`108765`.)"
msgstr ""
"Na Windows ``Python.h`` jiz neobsahuje standardni soubor hlavicky "
"``<stddef.h>``. Je-li potreba, mel by nyni byt zahrnut explicitne. Priklad: "
"poskytuje funkci :c:func:`!offsetof` a typy ``size_t`` a ``ptrdiff_t``. "
"Zahrnovani ``<stddef.h>`` explicitne bylo jiz potrebne pro vsechny ostatni "
"platformy, makro ``HAVE_STDDEF_H`` je pouze na Windows. (Prispel Victor "
"Stinner v :gh:`108765`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2711
msgid ""
"If the :c:macro:`Py_LIMITED_API` macro is defined, "
":c:macro:`!Py_BUILD_CORE`, :c:macro:`!Py_BUILD_CORE_BUILTIN` and "
":c:macro:`!Py_BUILD_CORE_MODULE` macros are now undefined by ``<Python.h>``."
" (Contributed by Victor Stinner in :gh:`85283`.)"
msgstr ""
"Pokud je makro :c:macro:`Py_LIMITED_API` definovano, jsou makra "
":c:macro:`!Py_BUILD_CORE`, :c:macro:`!Py_BUILD_CORE_BUILTIN` a "
":c:macro:`!Py_BUILD_CORE_MODULE` nyni nedefinovana ``<Python.h>``. (Prispel "
"Victor Stinner v :gh:`85283`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2716
msgid ""
"The old trashcan macros ``Py_TRASHCAN_SAFE_BEGIN`` and "
"``Py_TRASHCAN_SAFE_END`` were removed. They should be replaced by the new "
"macros ``Py_TRASHCAN_BEGIN`` and ``Py_TRASHCAN_END``."
msgstr ""
"Stara makra trashcanu ``Py_TRASHCAN_SAFE_BEGIN`` a ``Py_TRASHCAN_SAFE_END`` "
"byla odstranjeno. Mela by byt nahrazena novymi makry ``Py_TRASHCAN_BEGIN`` a"
" ``Py_TRASHCAN_END``."

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2720
msgid "A ``tp_dealloc`` function that has the old macros, such as::"
msgstr "Funkce ``tp_dealloc``, ktera obsahuje stara makra, jako je:"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2722
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"static void\n"
"mytype_dealloc(mytype *p)\n"
"{\n"
"    PyObject_GC_UnTrack(p);\n"
"    Py_TRASHCAN_SAFE_BEGIN(p);\n"
"    ...\n"
"    Py_TRASHCAN_SAFE_END\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"static void\n"
"mytype_dealloc(mytype *p)\n"
"{\n"
"    PyObject_GC_UnTrack(p);\n"
"    Py_TRASHCAN_SAFE_BEGIN(p);\n"
"    ...\n"
"    Py_TRASHCAN_SAFE_END\n"
"}"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2731
msgid "should migrate to the new macros as follows::"
msgstr "mela by emigrovat na nova makra nasledovne:"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2733
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"static void\n"
"mytype_dealloc(mytype *p)\n"
"{\n"
"    PyObject_GC_UnTrack(p);\n"
"    Py_TRASHCAN_BEGIN(p, mytype_dealloc)\n"
"    ...\n"
"    Py_TRASHCAN_END\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"static void\n"
"mytype_dealloc(mytype *p)\n"
"{\n"
"    PyObject_GC_UnTrack(p);\n"
"    Py_TRASHCAN_BEGIN(p, mytype_dealloc)\n"
"    ...\n"
"    Py_TRASHCAN_END\n"
"}"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2742
msgid ""
"Note that ``Py_TRASHCAN_BEGIN`` has a second argument which should be the "
"deallocation function it is in. The new macros were added in Python 3.8 and "
"the old macros were deprecated in Python 3.11. (Contributed by Irit Katriel "
"in :gh:`105111`.)"
msgstr ""
"Poznamka: ``Py_TRASHCAN_BEGIN`` ma druhy argument, ktery ma byt funkce "
"dealokace, ve ktere se naproti nachrazi. Nova makra byla pridana v Pythonu "
"3.8 a stara makra byla zastarale v Pythonu 3.11. (Prispel Irit Katriel v "
":gh:`105111`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2749
msgid ""
":ref:`PEP 667 <whatsnew313-locals-semantics>` introduces several changes to "
"frame-related functions:"
msgstr ""
":ref:`PEP 667 <whatsnew313-locals-semantics>` zavadi nektere zmeny funkcim "
"souvisejicim s framem:"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2752
msgid ""
"The effects of mutating the dictionary returned from "
":c:func:`PyEval_GetLocals` in an :term:`optimized scope` have changed. New "
"dict entries added this way will now *only* be visible to subsequent "
":c:func:`PyEval_GetLocals` calls in that frame, as "
":c:func:`PyFrame_GetLocals`, :func:`locals`, and :attr:`FrameType.f_locals "
"<frame.f_locals>` no longer access the same underlying cached dictionary. "
"Changes made to entries for actual variable names and names added via the "
"write-through proxy interfaces will be overwritten on subsequent calls to "
":c:func:`PyEval_GetLocals` in that frame. The recommended code update "
"depends on how the function was being used, so refer to the deprecation "
"notice on the function for details."
msgstr ""
"Vlivy mutace slovniku vracenych z :c:func:`PyEval_GetLocals` v "
":term:`optimized scope` se zmenly. Nove polozky dict pridan tuto cestou "
"budou nyni *pouze* videt nasledujicim volanim :c:func:`PyEval_GetLocals` v "
"tom framu, jako :c:func:`PyFrame_GetLocals`, :func:`locals` a "
":attr:`FrameType.f_locals <frame.f_locals>` jiz se nepristupuji k stejneho "
"podlozeneho cache slovniku. Zmeny provedene na vozbam pro skutecne jmena "
"promennych a jmena pridana pres proxy rozhrani na zpis budou preepsana na "
"nasledujicich volanich na :c:func:`PyEval_GetLocals` v tom framu. Doporucena"
" aktualizace kodu zalezi na tom, jak byla funkce pouzivana, takze si "
"prevezmete upozorneni na zastaralenosti funkce pro detaily."

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2765
msgid ""
"Calling :c:func:`PyFrame_GetLocals` in an :term:`optimized scope` now "
"returns a write-through proxy rather than a snapshot that gets updated at "
"ill-specified times. If a snapshot is desired, it must be created explicitly"
" (e.g. with :c:func:`PyDict_Copy`), or by calling the new "
":c:func:`PyEval_GetFrameLocals` API."
msgstr ""
"Volani :c:func:`PyFrame_GetLocals` v :term:`optimized scope` nyni vraci "
"proxy s zpetnym zapisem miste snimku, ktera se aktualizuje v "
"nespecifikovanych casech. Pokud je snimka pozadovana, musi byt vytvorena "
"explicitne (napr. s :c:func:`PyDict_Copy`), nebo volanim nove "
":c:func:`PyEval_GetFrameLocals` API."

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2772
msgid ""
":c:func:`!PyFrame_FastToLocals` and :c:func:`!PyFrame_FastToLocalsWithError`"
" no longer have any effect. Calling these functions has been redundant since"
" Python 3.11, when :c:func:`PyFrame_GetLocals` was first introduced."
msgstr ""
":c:func:`!PyFrame_FastToLocals` a :c:func:`!PyFrame_FastToLocalsWithError` "
"jiz nemaji zadny efekt. Volani techto funkci je zbytecne od Pythonu 3.11, "
"kdy byla :c:func:`PyFrame_GetLocals` poprveevrucena."

#: ../../whatsnew/3.13.rst:2777
msgid ""
":c:func:`!PyFrame_LocalsToFast` no longer has any effect. Calling this "
"function is redundant now that :c:func:`PyFrame_GetLocals` returns a write-"
"through proxy for :term:`optimized scopes <optimized scope>`."
