":c:func:`!PyFrame_LocalsToFast` jiz nema zadny efekt. Volani teto funkce je "
"nyni zbytecne, protoze :c:func:`PyFrame_GetLocals` vraci proxy s zpetnym "
"zapisem pro :term:`optimized scopes <optimized scope>`."

